{"page":299,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:46","surah":18,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْمَالُ وَٱلْبَنُونَ زِينَةُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَٱلْبَـٰقِيَـٰتُ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ خَيْرٌ عِندَ رَبِّكَ ثَوَابًا وَخَيْرٌ أَمَلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Wealth and children are the attractions of this worldly life, but lasting good works have a better reward with your Lord and give better grounds for hope.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْمَالُ","en_gloss":"The wealth","transliteration":"al-mālu","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱلْبَنُونَ","en_gloss":"and children","transliteration":"wal-banūna","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"زِينَةُ","en_gloss":"(are) adornment","transliteration":"zīnatu","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْبَـٰقِيَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"But the enduring","transliteration":"wal-bāqiyātu","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥātu","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"(are) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثَوَابًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) reward","transliteration":"thawāban","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَخَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"and better","transliteration":"wakhayrun","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَمَلًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) hope","transliteration":"amalan","verse_key":"18:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:46"}]},{"verse_key":"18:47","surah":18,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ نُسَيِّرُ ٱلْجِبَالَ وَتَرَى ٱلْأَرْضَ بَارِزَةً وَحَشَرْنَـٰهُمْ فَلَمْ نُغَادِرْ مِنْهُمْ أَحَدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"One day We shall make the mountains move, and you will see the earth as an open plain. We shall gather all people together, leaving no one.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And the Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُسَيِّرُ","en_gloss":"We will cause (to) move","transliteration":"nusayyiru","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالَ","en_gloss":"the mountains","transliteration":"l-jibāla","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَتَرَى","en_gloss":"and you will see","transliteration":"watarā","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَارِزَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) a leveled plain","transliteration":"bārizatan","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَحَشَرْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We will gather them","transliteration":"waḥasharnāhum","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"falam","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نُغَادِرْ","en_gloss":"We will leave behind","transliteration":"nughādir","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadan","verse_key":"18:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:47"}]},{"verse_key":"18:48","surah":18,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَعُرِضُوا۟ عَلَىٰ رَبِّكَ صَفًّا لَّقَدْ جِئْتُمُونَا كَمَا خَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ أَوَّلَ مَرَّةٍۭ ۚ بَلْ زَعَمْتُمْ أَلَّن نَّجْعَلَ لَكُم مَّوْعِدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will be lined up before your Lord: ‘Now you have come to Us as We first created you, although you claimed We had not made any such appointment for you.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعُرِضُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they will be presented","transliteration":"waʿuriḍū","verse_key":"18:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"18:48"},{"